24205bf24239"],

Cell["\<\
The low-order numerical approximation is obtained by using the low order \
model in the entire domain.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.903860577380809*^9, 3.9038606035230646`*^9}, {
  3.931579122035612*^9, 3.9315791533640227`*^9}},
